          "text": "/\n\n\"Testimony of a witness, It was a large, circular object with lights, moving slowly in the sky, on __UFO_PROTECTED_000__ 16th, ~R-O~, 4JJ6ELO. It was 11:18 PM, I was looking at the stars when I saw it. It had a pot-like shape and moved slowly, like a plane, but it was much larger. It had lights on its upper part and another light in the center. It was a clear night, with no clouds. I went outside to see better and it was still there, moving very slowly. It was then that I noticed the lights were changing colors. It was a fantastic sight. I watched it for about 10 minutes until it disappeared slowly, leaving a red trail behind.\"\n\n\"Police investigation (J()M;t­ (J/QO/lAJI ( (131-1)\"",
